From 5718fa25357feef7bf60dab3ce6d9ae74fde468a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:22:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Exercise VR failures and distinguish replayed cameras from
 unknown poses

Add launch-only allocation/focus diagnostics, defer GPU initialization while focus is absent, read pacing flags under their mutex and keep overlay ownership typed to the render context. Skip a known consumed camera when its new pose has not arrived, retaining the documented fallback only for truly unknown cameras.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
